F('soils','Marine deposits||海相沉积','Sands, silts and clays vary locally; compact marl can limit rooting depth.||砂、粉砂、黏土随地点变化；紧实泥灰岩可限制根深。','nizzaterroir'),
F('climate','Water balance||水分平衡','Sandy parcels retain less moisture and face greater drought stress than clay-rich sites.||砂地保水较少，比富黏土地块面临更大干旱压力。','nizzaterroir'),
F('grapes','Composition||组成','100% Barbera.||100% Barbera。'),
F('viticulture','Exposure||坡向','Hillsides facing south, southeast or southwest.||南、东南或西南向坡地。'),
F('viticulture','Training||架式','Vertical training; Guyot or low spur-pruned cordon; ≥4,000 vines/ha.||直立架式；Guyot 或低位短梢单臂；≥4,000 株/公顷。'),
F('viticulture','Yield||产量','7 t/ha; Vigna 6.3 t/ha.||7 吨/公顷；Vigna 6.3 吨/公顷。'),
